  "pseudocode": "x = clamp(scale*(lpw-lpl) - margin, -clip, clip); per_pair = -logsigmoid(x); if weight: w = clamp(weight,0, wmax); loss = sum(per_pair*w)/(sum(w)+eps) else mean(per_pair)",
